WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.540
Let's start again.

2
00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:09.100
This is August the 9th, 1905.

3
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.800
Louisa says, continuing in my usual state,

4
00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.380
I was feeling a little disturbed.

5
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.060
And we know from volumes one to four

6
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:19.560
that she was told not to allow any disturbance.

7
00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:22.820
But there's no guarantee against the vicissitudes

8
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.260
of everyday life, is there?

9
00:00:25.260 --> 00:00:28.920
So, and blessed Jesus on coming told me, my daughter,

10
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:32.960
the soul who is at peace and whose whole being tends

11
00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.760
completely to me.

12
00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.960
Now, that's the bit you underline,

13
00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:42.560
whose whole being tends completely unto me.

14
00:00:42.560 --> 00:00:45.960
That's Deuteronomy 6 verses 4 to 10.

15
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:52.120
This soul drips with drops of light.

16
00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:53.880
Now, you know that God is light,

17
00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:57.600
so divine will is light, which fall upon my garment

18
00:00:57.600 --> 00:00:59.360
and form an ornament.

19
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:02.280
Now, why does it fall on his garment?

20
00:01:02.280 --> 00:01:04.040
Is because God is light.

21
00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:09.760
And only drops of light can actually touch him, okay?

22
00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:12.520
On the other hand, the soul who is disturbed

23
00:01:12.520 --> 00:01:16.600
drips with darkness, which forms the diabolical ornament

24
00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:19.320
and most certainly can't touch him.

25
00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:23.160
Not only this, but disturbance impedes the course of grace

26
00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.400
and renders it unable to operate in good.

27
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.960
Unfortunately, we all know for our experience

28
00:01:29.960 --> 00:01:32.560
that you can get disturbed, and you can't even pray afterwards,

29
00:01:32.560 --> 00:01:34.960
and sometimes you can't even think, can you?

30
00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:36.160
Okay.

31
00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:40.960
So, then he added, if the soul becomes disturbed over everything,

32
00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:44.360
that means over all the small things of everyday life.

33
00:01:44.360 --> 00:01:47.640
It is a sign that she's full of herself.

34
00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.360
Now, would you underline that in green, white and gold?

35
00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:52.280
So, if we get disturbed about everything,

36
00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:56.120
it means that we are full of ourselves and not full of him.

37
00:01:56.120 --> 00:01:59.840
If we're full of him, then there's drops of light coming from us

38
00:01:59.840 --> 00:02:02.360
and adorning him.

39
00:02:02.360 --> 00:02:06.560
If she becomes disturbed, she is usually the soul.

40
00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:10.440
If she becomes disturbed with something that happens to her,

41
00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.880
but not with something else, it's a sign

42
00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:16.880
that she has something of God, but there are many voids to be filled.

43
00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:19.480
I think that probably fits us better.

44
00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:22.560
That there are bits filled in and there are bits not filled in.

45
00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:24.680
That's a bit like saying that you're painting a wall

46
00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:28.040
and somebody says, "Would you forgot that bit?"

47
00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.960
And you thought you were as straight as a die.

48
00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:33.440
They said, "No, no, no, you forgot that bit."

49
00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.680
If there's nothing disturbs her, it is a sign

50
00:02:36.680 --> 00:02:39.680
that she's all filled with God.

51
00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:43.080
Oh, how much harm disturbance does to the soul,

52
00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:47.720
to the point of rejecting God and filling her completely with herself.

53
00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.880
Now, you need to put a VIP on that

54
00:02:49.880 --> 00:02:55.240
because that is major discernment about whether or not

55
00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:59.120
we have truly given ourselves to the Lord.

56
00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:02.760
And the thing is, if you find, at a particular point,

57
00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:06.200
that you did let the disturbance in, welcome to the human race.

58
00:03:06.200 --> 00:03:07.560
You know what I mean?

59
00:03:07.560 --> 00:03:11.280
But if you did find it, what you don't do is get upset and say,

60
00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:13.160
"There I am, I never get it right."

61
00:03:13.160 --> 00:03:14.240
You don't do that.

62
00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:18.520
You just go and plunge your nothingness into his oneness, OK?

63
00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:21.080
And say, "Jesus, cover me with your precious blood.

64
00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:22.920
And together, we can do this.

65
00:03:22.920 --> 00:03:25.160
I can't do it by myself."

66
00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.440
Is that OK?

67
00:03:26.440 --> 00:03:28.600
That's very important.

68
00:03:28.600 --> 00:03:34.720
So August the 17th, 1905, all the glory of the soul

69
00:03:34.720 --> 00:03:37.680
is to be told that of everything she has,

70
00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:40.680
nothing is hers but all of God.

71
00:03:40.680 --> 00:03:43.640
Now, if you get to the stage where everything you have

72
00:03:43.640 --> 00:03:47.240
is all of God, you are ready for heaven.

73
00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.400
Continuing in my usual statement, of course,

74
00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:54.640
since none of us are on the call, the heavenly home call

75
00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.360
at this moment, it means none of us are ready.

76
00:03:57.360 --> 00:03:59.000
Is that OK?

77
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.760
We're all in the same form.

78
00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:07.520
We're still on the train, but the station hasn't been called yet.

79
00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.680
That's the funny part of this, if you just look at it

80
00:04:09.680 --> 00:04:12.320
from the other angle, sometimes we're only looking at it

81
00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.320
like I haven't made it, I haven't made it.

82
00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:17.280
Your journey isn't finished, that's all.

83
00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:21.560
So continuing my usual statement, I saw the Queen Mother,

84
00:04:21.560 --> 00:04:24.920
who was saying to our Lord, come, come into her garden

85
00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:25.960
to delight.

86
00:04:25.960 --> 00:04:30.600
Now, that's Song of Songs 4, 16, OK?

87
00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:34.360
Song of Songs 4, 16.

88
00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:37.040
And it seemed that she was pointing to me.

89
00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:39.040
On hearing this, I felt full of blushes,

90
00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:41.680
and I said to myself, I've nothing good at all.

91
00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.400
How can he delight?

92
00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.920
As I was thinking of this, blessed Jesus told me, my daughter,

93
00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:49.360
why do you blush?

94
00:04:49.360 --> 00:04:54.720
All the glory of a soul is to be told that of everything

95
00:04:54.720 --> 00:04:59.000
she has, nothing is hers, but all is of God.

96
00:04:59.000 --> 00:05:04.400
And I in exchange say to her, everything that is mine is hers.

97
00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:09.760
That's your John 14, 20 to 21.

98
00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:12.760
So he says, you give all of yourself to me,

99
00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.960
I give all of myself to you.

100
00:05:14.960 --> 00:05:19.000
There's that lovely story of Patrick Peele, who was asked,

101
00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:22.040
how is it that the Lord works so many miracles through you

102
00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.120
and not through other people?

103
00:05:23.120 --> 00:05:25.600
And he answered, kind of, Patrick Peele

104
00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:26.360
was able to show--

105
00:05:26.360 --> 00:05:28.800
a tricky shoulder like that, when what are you asking?

106
00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:32.160
He said, I refuse him, nothing, and he refuses me, nothing.

107
00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:34.440
So where's the mystery?

108
00:05:34.440 --> 00:05:36.440
Because that's exactly what Jesus is saying here.

109
00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:40.600
You give yourself all to me, I give myself all to you.

110
00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:42.200
And while he was saying this, it seemed

111
00:05:42.200 --> 00:05:45.680
that my little garden, which he himself had made--

112
00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.800
because everything comes from him--

113
00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:50.600
would unite with his more extensive

114
00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.520
which he kept in his heart, and they would become one,

115
00:05:53.520 --> 00:05:55.640
and we would delight together.

116
00:05:55.640 --> 00:06:00.320
And then she was back in her own self out of the ecstasy.

117
00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:07.640
So August the 20th, 1905, grace assumes as many images

118
00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:11.680
around the soul for as many are the divine perfections

119
00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:12.440
and virtues.

120
00:06:12.440 --> 00:06:15.960
Now, don't forget that grace is an outpouring of God himself.

121
00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:18.320
Jesus said, I am grace.

122
00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.240
And you just need to remember that.

123
00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:22.920
OK.

124
00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.320
At this morning, oncoming, blessed Jesus told me,

125
00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:29.120
my daughter, if in all of her actions

126
00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:32.040
the soul does everything for God.

127
00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:35.880
And to please God alone, grace enters into the soul

128
00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:37.720
from all sides.

129
00:06:37.720 --> 00:06:42.080
Now, notice that's called placing the intention.

130
00:06:42.080 --> 00:06:46.040
The intention is all the important thing.

131
00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:49.680
The fact that I lift this container of water off the table

132
00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:52.120
is neither here nor there.

133
00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:55.520
But if I do it with the intention of glorifying God

134
00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:59.480
and loving Him alone, then the action is valuable.

135
00:06:59.480 --> 00:07:00.480
Is that OK?

136
00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:03.320
The intention makes all the difference.

137
00:07:03.320 --> 00:07:08.280
And very often, we forget to place the intention.

138
00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:10.800
Grace enters into that soul from all sides,

139
00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.520
just as the light of the sun enters from all sides

140
00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:17.320
into a house where balconies, doors, and windows are open.

141
00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.880
And one enjoys all the fullness of the light.

142
00:07:19.880 --> 00:07:22.920
In the same way, the soul enjoys all the fullness

143
00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:24.480
of the divine light.

144
00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:26.640
Now, the divine light is the divine will.

145
00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:30.920
You need to put that at the side, just D.W.

146
00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:34.080
And through the response of the soul,

147
00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:38.920
this light keeps increasing always until she becomes all light.

148
00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:45.120
That means fully spiritualized as we read earlier today.

149
00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:49.160
But if she does otherwise, the light enters through the cracks.

150
00:07:49.160 --> 00:07:51.400
And in the soul, everything is darkness,

151
00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:55.240
because it's like you have put boards up against the windows

152
00:07:55.240 --> 00:07:58.800
so that the light can come in through the cracks.

153
00:07:58.800 --> 00:08:02.000
My daughter, to one who gives me everything,

154
00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.600
I give everything.

155
00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:07.280
That is underlined for you again.

156
00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:09.760
And since the soul is not capable of receiving

157
00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:14.920
my being altogether, Grace assumes as many images

158
00:08:14.920 --> 00:08:19.360
around the soul for as many are my perfections and virtues.

159
00:08:19.360 --> 00:08:25.280
So Grace manifests itself in all kinds of ways.

160
00:08:25.280 --> 00:08:27.400
So it assumes the image of beauty.

161
00:08:27.400 --> 00:08:28.280
That's number one.

162
00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:36.200
And it communicates the light of beauty to the soul.

163
00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:40.240
Two, it communicates the image of wisdom,

164
00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.280
and it communicates the light of wisdom.

165
00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:47.560
Three, the image of goodness and communicates

166
00:08:47.560 --> 00:08:51.880
goodness for the image of sanctity,

167
00:08:51.880 --> 00:08:56.560
five, justice, six, fortitude, seven, power, and eight,

168
00:08:56.560 --> 00:09:00.280
purity, all the different ways that the Grace of God

169
00:09:00.280 --> 00:09:02.720
actually manifests itself in us.

170
00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.480
And of course, these are all reflections

171
00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:08.080
of the divine perfections.

172
00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.280
And it communicates the light of sanctity,

173
00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:13.200
justice, fortitude, power, and purity.

174
00:09:13.200 --> 00:09:15.440
And so with all the rest.

175
00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:19.080
So the soul is studded, not with one sun,

176
00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:22.880
but with as many suns for as many are my perfections.

177
00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:26.240
And these images are present around the soul.

178
00:09:26.240 --> 00:09:31.840
Only for those who are open and who respond to them,

179
00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.440
they are all activity and working.

180
00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:38.560
For those souls who are not, they are as though asleep

181
00:09:38.560 --> 00:09:41.720
and little can be done in their activity.

182
00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:46.800
So we have to be open and let the divine Grace actually

183
00:09:46.800 --> 00:09:48.760
work its work in us.

184
00:09:48.760 --> 00:09:52.000
We have to be willing to receive it

185
00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.320
and willing to move with it.

186
00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.840
And if we're lazy and we just don't bother,

187
00:09:56.840 --> 00:09:59.000
then it's not going to happen.

188
00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:03.560
So August the 22nd, 1905.

189
00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:08.040
One who shares with Jesus the weight of his sufferings,

190
00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:11.800
that is the work of his redemption, comes to participate

191
00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:16.560
and in the gain of the work of redemption.

192
00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:19.160
As I was in my usual state, my adorable Jesus

193
00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:21.920
came for just a little, Louisa said,

194
00:10:21.920 --> 00:10:25.600
and he transported me outside of myself.

195
00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.840
He shared his sufferings with me, and then he told me,

196
00:10:28.840 --> 00:10:32.440
my daughter, when two people share together the weight

197
00:10:32.440 --> 00:10:35.600
of a work, notice the weight of a work.

198
00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:39.360
That means the work of redemption is very difficult,

199
00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:43.840
and so it's given as weight, as heavy.

200
00:10:43.840 --> 00:10:46.480
Together they share the compensation

201
00:10:46.480 --> 00:10:49.880
that they receive from that work, and both of them

202
00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:54.440
can do good to whomever they want with that compensation.

203
00:10:54.440 --> 00:10:56.880
In other words, what you get from the divine will,

204
00:10:56.880 --> 00:11:00.400
you can decide who to give it to.

205
00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:03.280
But if you're still at the stage of wanting only

206
00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:06.640
to give to one or two people, or you're just your friends,

207
00:11:06.640 --> 00:11:09.560
or your family, you're now really into divine will,

208
00:11:09.560 --> 00:11:11.640
because God's love is universal.

209
00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:14.600
And he loves every human being past, present, and future

210
00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:17.000
with exactly the same love.

211
00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:19.640
And when we start praying the way he prays,

212
00:11:19.640 --> 00:11:23.960
we're praying for all souls past, present, and future.

213
00:11:23.960 --> 00:11:25.680
So if you pray for an individual,

214
00:11:25.680 --> 00:11:29.440
you have to put that prayer also onto everybody

215
00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.960
else who has the same needs.

216
00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:33.000
Is that OK?

217
00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:34.080
You have to include them all.

218
00:11:34.080 --> 00:11:39.640
And since the compensation for our pains

219
00:11:39.640 --> 00:11:41.560
is divided between you and me, I

220
00:11:41.560 --> 00:11:44.200
can do good to whomever I want in general,

221
00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.320
and also in a special way, as the general and the particular.

222
00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:51.200
And you too are free to do good to whomever you want

223
00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:54.120
with the compensation that's due to you.

224
00:11:54.120 --> 00:11:57.880
This is the gain for one who shares my pains with me, which

225
00:11:57.880 --> 00:12:02.800
is conceded only to the state of the victim's soul.

226
00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:05.480
The victim's soul is in a very different position to you

227
00:12:05.480 --> 00:12:06.280
and me.

228
00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.240
We can pray in general for everybody

229
00:12:08.240 --> 00:12:10.320
about the victim's soul, because they

230
00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:13.960
take on the actual sufferings of Christ for others,

231
00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:17.720
and they stand between the sinner and the justice of God,

232
00:12:17.720 --> 00:12:20.960
they are allowed a very special participation in this

233
00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:23.280
that nobody else has.

234
00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:27.000
And very often, Jesus just refers to them as loving souls

235
00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.600
as if the rest of us didn't love him.

236
00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:33.200
You know what I mean? They're just very special to him,

237
00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:36.440
which is conceded only to the state of the victim's soul.

238
00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:40.680
And it is a gain for those who are closest to the victim's soul,

239
00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:44.440
because by being close, they can participate more easily

240
00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:47.800
in the goods that this person possesses.

241
00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:51.680
Therefore, my daughter rejoices, the more I share my pains

242
00:12:51.680 --> 00:12:56.440
with you, because greater will be your share of compensation.

243
00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:58.440
And then we read already this morning

244
00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:01.080
that if the priest stays close enough to Louisa,

245
00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.440
he'll get his bit.

246
00:13:03.440 --> 00:13:06.840
But if he moves away, he won't.

247
00:13:06.840 --> 00:13:14.560
So August the 23rd, 1905, if the soul does everything for God,

248
00:13:14.560 --> 00:13:17.160
now it's the everything you underline,

249
00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:19.560
we're inclined to do some things.

250
00:13:19.560 --> 00:13:22.120
Everything is a very big word.

251
00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:26.400
She remains extinguished in the flame of divine love.

252
00:13:26.400 --> 00:13:31.240
That means the ego is extinguished, the self is extinguished,

253
00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:34.240
and you are taken up into divine love,

254
00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:38.440
which, of course, is the condition of the blessed in heaven.

255
00:13:38.440 --> 00:13:42.920
